      "text": "of continuous representations z = (z1, ..., zn). Given z, the decoder then generates an output",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The encoder is composed of a stack of N = 6 identical layers. Each layer has two",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "layers, produce outputs of dimension dmodel = 512.",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The decoder is also composed of a stack of N = 6 identical layers. In addition to the two",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Attention(Q, K, V ) = softmax(QKT",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "variables with mean 0 and variance 1. Then their dot product, q · k = Pdk",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "i=1 qiki, has mean 0 and variance dk.",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "MultiHead(Q, K, V ) = Concat(head1, ..., headh)W O",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "where headi = Attention(QW Q",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "∈Rdmodel×dk, W K",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "∈Rdmodel×dk, W V",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "∈Rdmodel×dv",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "and W O ∈Rhdv×dmodel.",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "In this work we employ h = 8 parallel attention layers, or heads. For each of these we use",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "dk = dv = dmodel/h = 64. Due to the reduced dimension of each head, the total computational cost",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "FFN(x) = max(0, xW1 + b1)W2 + b2",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The dimensionality of input and output is dmodel = 512, and the inner-layer has dimensionality",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "dff = 2048.",
      "section_id": "sec:background",
