      "text": "used beam search with a beam size of 4 and length penalty α = 0.6 [38]. These hyperparameters",
      "section_id": "sec:results",
      "page_start": 8,
      "page_end": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "We trained a 4-layer transformer with dmodel = 1024 on the Wall Street Journal (WSJ) portion of the",
